{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaper Actual is an Open-World Persistent Shooter where players deploy into the field as Reapers (Tier 1 Operators) to engage in fast-paced FPS combat mixed with the persistence of an MMORPG. On the Island of Marova, players also have Bases which act as their home base for every deployment and extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/8bf83b0dffdb824b1c00a69d2d64759e.avif?t=1765690958\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras_big/8bf83b0dffdb824b1c00a69d2d64759e.webp?t=1765690958 width=1560 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use their Base to brief &amp; restock before they venture out on missions for and against the 5 NPC Factions that occupy Marova's infrastructure, as they acquire gear and level their Reaper, weapons, and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/02c18bbf1a06fd1a931b1d00a46ab2c2.avif?t=1765690958\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras_big/02c18bbf1a06fd1a931b1d00a46ab2c2.webp?t=1765690958 width=1560 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you complete missions, you're likely to encounter other players as hundreds deploy across the island to engage in PvPvE battles for supremacy. Each deployment, make sure you are always looking over your shoulder for whoever may be ready to take a shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/1165afe2142f5913b25cc0db18f4cfe3.avif?t=1765690958\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras_big/1165afe2142f5913b25cc0db18f4cfe3.webp?t=1765690958 width=1560 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Air, Land, and Sea vehicles (coming soon) at their disposal, any Reaper can find themselves in one of Marova's 5 different biomes with missions ranging from intense HVT missions to collecting scarce resources needed for a deep crafting system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/2e50c0b806bdeb8e67ad08f34d1f5ffe.avif?t=1765690958\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras_big/2e50c0b806bdeb8e67ad08f34d1f5ffe.webp?t=1765690958 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2995670?t=1765690958","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/72be059638c669658343fed659e825f8b532be3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765690958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/e6159269e89629d80da66a5bd768559edcbb2eae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765690958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/e6159269e89629d80da66a5bd768559edcbb2eae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765690958","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Reaper Actual features realistic looking violence including gunfights, blood, and character deaths within a war-torn world. The game features violent crime and war."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaper Actual is an Open-World Persistent Shooter where players deploy into the field as Reapers (Tier 1 Operators) to engage in fast-paced FPS combat mixed with the persistence of an MMORPG. On the Island of Marova, players also have Bases which act as their home base for every deployment and extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/8bf83b0dffdb824b1c00a69d2d64759e.avif?t=1765690958\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras_big/8bf83b0dffdb824b1c00a69d2d64759e.webp?t=1765690958 width=1560 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use their Base to brief &amp; restock before they venture out on missions for and against the 5 NPC Factions that occupy Marova's infrastructure, as they acquire gear and level their Reaper, weapons, and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/02c18bbf1a06fd1a931b1d00a46ab2c2.avif?t=1765690958\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras_big/02c18bbf1a06fd1a931b1d00a46ab2c2.webp?t=1765690958 width=1560 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you complete missions, you're likely to encounter other players as hundreds deploy across the island to engage in PvPvE battles for supremacy. Each deployment, make sure you are always looking over your shoulder for whoever may be ready to take a shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/1165afe2142f5913b25cc0db18f4cfe3.avif?t=1765690958\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras_big/1165afe2142f5913b25cc0db18f4cfe3.webp?t=1765690958 width=1560 height=844 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Air, Land, and Sea vehicles (coming soon) at their disposal, any Reaper can find themselves in one of Marova's 5 different biomes with missions ranging from intense HVT missions to collecting scarce resources needed for a deep crafting system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras/2e50c0b806bdeb8e67ad08f34d1f5ffe.avif?t=1765690958\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/extras_big/2e50c0b806bdeb8e67ad08f34d1f5ffe.webp?t=1765690958 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Distinct Possibility Studios, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995670/37594def017ea02a790bfe4f0da40afd1c2ebc8f/header.jpg?t=1765690958","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Reaper Actual\u2122 and the Reaper Actual logo are trademarks of Distinct Possibility Studios, Inc. \u00a9 2025 Distinct Possibility Studios, Inc. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steam